{"name":"13-5-1First","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"229","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At the power generators. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Several minutes ago."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange, we've entered the heart of the base. The heat signature that we detected earlier is also approaching, but we definitely got here sooner."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A mech isn't too maneuverable in such confined spaces. What about our other members?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They will be here in one minute."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is probably a little too late, but since you're sending us light-weight Dolls to fight a mech of that caliber, have you considered equipping each of us with something like M4's particle cannon?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If I get out of this alive, I might get Persica to build you some.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In other words, we're on our own right now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Instead of griping, running simulations for the upcoming fight would be a better use of time.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can gripe and run 20 different simulations simultaneously. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Though I doubt you'd want to know their outcome."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm getting a much higher rate of success than you in my simulation.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's because I don't take your death-seeking tendencies into consideration."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I really may not walk out of this alive. What I need is a solution that is guaranteed to eliminate the enemy.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You think too much of yourself, Ange. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It might be a different story if we were talking about a battle of wits, but your presence has pretty much no influence on the outcome when it comes to head-on fights like this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange, 12, our teammates are in position."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We seem to be right on time. Perfect. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We meet again, 12. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I told you we wouldn't be parted for long."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was starting to question Ange's decision of making you the babysitter, but you're surprisingly good at the job. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Got any presents for me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will give it to you when the time is right. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, 15, carry on. We mustn't argue with those we've been charged to protect, okay?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Right. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ammo."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh...! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"D-do you need spare ammo? I have some here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Heh, a special snowflake who uses a different kind of ammo than everyone else and needs others to carry spare ammo just for her. What a pain in the ass. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you agree, 94?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... I don't mind..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Rounds of larger caliber are needed against armored units. 5.45mm just won't cut it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Spoken like a true musclehead. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps fighting the mech in hand-to-hand combat would be the most effective?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"94 is always so reliable and accommodating to all kinds of troublesome partners. That's certainly a gift."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't have to be such a goody-two-shoes to the female gorilla, 94. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are you – you're not my adjunct, or anyone else's."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? I..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, I don't want to interrupt your little sorority party, but we don't have much time to waste on idle chit-chat.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have been downloading 12's battle plan the whole time, you know? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks to you, she's come up with a pretty brilliant idea. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Though our epitaphs could certainly use a bit more work."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh dear, do you have any better suggestions?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Haha, you jest."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then be a good girl and back yourself up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just like last time, eh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Exactly like last time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's always such a pleasure working with you, 12. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"15, the floor plan indicates that there's some large equipment in the generator room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dismantle it and build some barricades with the debris. I've marked the locations out for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How obedient. Very unlike the AK-15 who usually turns her nose up at tactics. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You also have a way with troublesome partners."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"15 is just critical in her thinking. You simply have to let her speak her mind. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At least she doesn't play copycat."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, don't be mad. It was just a joke. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We're going to get along swell, don't you think?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop talking in riddles. Explain the plan to me in the most concise way that I can understand.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"12 has already fleshed out most of it, and I have no doubt that the Griffin Commander will succeed in blowing the valves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Now since you want to survive AND complete the mission, there is only one possible solution."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We are going to intercept Yegor from Generator Room 3. That's the only place where we can control the drainage system. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The terrain is also very complex in there. We will seal off all other passages to lure the mech into the room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Once he enters the ambush zone, we will attack from multiple directions to disperse the Sinner's fire. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We can only pray that Yegor's firing system isn't optimal in the confined space. Banking on that, our probability of success is about 5%"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just 5%...?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's the optimistic estimation. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As for you... Just sit tight and watch the board. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The chess player never enters the fray."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If we win, how about triple the bonus and give your pieces new bodies, eh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now don't be unreasonable. There are two among us who are a waste of resources."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let it slide, 15, 94. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"12 is just trying to be encouraging."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The barricades are ready. Are there any other supplies?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These are all the explosives we have on hand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood, I will use them wisely. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That side is yours."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, I'm on it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you sure you want to go ahead with the plan?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You and RPK can try to think of a better one, but I'm definitely smarter than both of you combined, so there isn't a better plan."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't this what makes Dolls so handy? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Death is our prerogative, and victory is yours, Ange. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's weird for you to feel compassion for us. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just let us have some fun."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph... Do whatever you want.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh right, if you can't afford to give all of us upgrades... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll take 7N39 AP rounds for my drum magazines next time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just next time? Make that the next five times."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And throw in the latest processor as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeDamage","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Now you're hitting it off, huh?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sure, but I'll have to get back before UMP45 sucks my account dry, you see what I mean?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Deal. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Now then, come with me. The enemy is close."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RPK16","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RPK-16","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Right."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK15","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Got it."}]}]}]}
